//api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-18T03:32:32Z","updated_at":"2023-09-18T03:32:32Z","body":"agreed @karsten-klein - it also adds at the start:\r\n\r\nThe United States Government has rights in this work pursuant\r\nto contract no. DE-AC03-76SF00098 between the United States\r\nDepartment of Energy and the University of California.\r\n\r\nWhich I take as intended to be part of the license text (not \"license\" technically, but more of a notice)\r\n\r\nI'd be inclined to add as a new license and use something like `BSD-3-Clause-Flex` to be consistent with other variants like this\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1722707786/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1723902251","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2104#issuecomment-1723902251","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2104","id":1723902251,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85mwKkr","user":{"login":"Pizza-Ria","id":46799628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2Nzk5NjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46799628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria","html_url":"https://github.com/Pizza-Ria","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-18T16:30:30Z","updated_at":"2023-09-18T16:30:30Z","body":"I agree that the USG language takes it out of being subsumed but I could be OK with a variant version.  Also, I think these kind of notices may be more common so I'd rather the license-name give a clue as to the variation so maybe BSD-3-Clause-USG?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1723902251/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1724494957","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2104#issuecomment-1724494957","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2104","id":1724494957,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85mybRt","user":{"login":"InSwiss","id":6169105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNjkxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6169105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss","html_url":"https://github.com/InSwiss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-18T21:41:00Z","updated_at":"2023-09-18T21:41:00Z","body":"Reviewed this issue. It is a BSD style license – 3 clause and disclaimer is from BSD-4 shortened. The last 2 paragraphs are in addition so it can be accepted as new license. It was not found in OSA. License name ‘Flex 2.6.4 License´ suggestion isn’t very intuitive.  The earlier version of Flex also has same license so putting a versioning in name isn’t helpful. I agree with suggestions from others that it should be name with BSD -3 Clause in the name like 'BSD 3-Clause Flex modified'. We can do 'BSD 3-Clause-USG' but I am not sure if anyone else would have the same contract number as mentioned here :  \"The United States Government has rights in this work pursuant to contract no. DE-AC03-76SF00098 between the United States\r\nDepartment of Energy and the University of California.\" ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1724494957/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1725338997","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2104#issuecomment-1725338997","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2104","id":1725338997,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85m1pV1","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-19T11:42:08Z","updated_at":"2023-09-19T11:42:08Z","body":"+1 to add with the text from the COPYING file linked above.\r\n\r\nI'm fine with either `flex` or `BSD-3-Clause-flex` as the ID, and choosing a corresponding license name to align with either of those.\r\n\r\nI think referencing \"flex\" in the ID and name is appropriate here. I probably wouldn't include the flex version number.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1725338997/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1725383163","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2104#issuecomment-1725383163","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2104","id":1725383163,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85m10H7","user":{"login":"submachine","id":1934512,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzQ1MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1934512?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/submachine","html_url":"https://github.com/submachine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/submachine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/submachine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/submachine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"