Inglis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-19T13:13:33Z","updated_at":"2023-09-19T13:13:33Z","body":"It might be good to see if the actual primary contract IP terms could be found, but may have been issued in 1976, as papers with subcontracts from the early 1980s...2000s mention it, without any links, and may be for the initial LBNL applied energy research and efficiency and standards initiatives after the 1970s energy \"crisis\": see recent contract updates \r\n[UC/LBNL Contracts](https://www.ucop.edu/laboratory-management/contracts/lbnl/archived-contracts.html)\r\n[UC/LBNL Contract Modifications](https://www.ucop.edu/laboratory-management/contracts/lbnl/modifications.html) \r\n[Latest Modification](https://www.ucop.edu/laboratory-management/_files/contracts/lbnl_k_m390.pdf)\r\nsays under 7.2(b)(1)(i) that USG gains ownership of any software, which could place the software in the PD; \r\nunless that software is developed other than under the contract, and LBNL, UCB, or a subcontractor attaches Restricted Computer Software Rights); \r\nwhile LBNL, UCB, or a subcontractor (depending on their terms) may request copyright to pursue commercialization. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1725485047/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1738369482","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2104#issuecomment-1738369482","issue_url":"https